You were asked for a "class of monster" ("What class of monsters do you
wish to genocide?", not "What monster do you want to genocide? [type the
name]"). This means that you can genocide a whole class of monsters,
those which are represented by a particular symbol in the ASCII
interface. This happens if the scroll of genocide is blessed. To kill
mind flayers (and dwarves, hobbits and bugbears), type "h" (the symbol)
or "humanoids" (the description of the class). 

